2048 in Brainfuck

Input is one byte seeding the random numbers and then one byte per
keyup with its key code  37 left  38 up  39 right  40 down
After the seed and after every key it prints the markup of the main
element  score  result and the grid with its colours
Squares hold exponents  0 is empty  1 is 2  11 is 2048
Every sweep over the squares rotates the board through B0 16 times
Stops at end of input

tape  rotation slot and squares 15 down to 0  partner square
pair valid  column counter  row counter  pass counter  combining
random state  six temps  column move  row move  random square
sliding  towards the start  towards the end  arrow key
generate retry  game over  square counter  listening  key  won
default result  switch value and flag  five pens  create counter
pen helper  exponent  four digits of 2 to the exponent
divmod workspace of six  digit seen  two temps  digit pen
six digits of the score

